      ],
      "source": "https://www.wkchamber.org/about/history-of-wheaton-kensington/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Downtown Wheaton centers around a triangle formed by Veirs Mill Road, University Boulevard, and Georgia Avenue.",
